{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.BraidKnot.jet_prefix_gb_filtration","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.jet_prefix_gb_filtration","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.BigOperators.Group.Finset.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Real.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.FieldSimp"],"declarations":3,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.not_jet_prefix_gb_filtration_of_free_data","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.not_jet_prefix_gb_filtration_of_free_data","kind":"theorem","line":110,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/jet_prefix_gb_filtration.lean#L110-L117","doc":"**The evaluation is refutable at freely-chosen data**, which is why it is\nnamed rather than carried as a `sorry`.\n\nWith no partitions the denominator is `0`, so the right-hand side is `0` and\n`a_k = 1` fails. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.trM_eq_of_jet_prefix","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.trM_eq_of_jet_prefix","kind":"theorem","line":91,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/jet_prefix_gb_filtration.lean#L91-L108","doc":"**The cleared-denominator form**, derived.\n\nWhen the weighted restriction-multiplicity sum is nonzero, the evaluation is\nequivalent to `a_k · Σ_λ w_λ · dim Res = tr_M^{[ℓ]}`.\n\nThe hypothesis is doing real work rather than tidying: Lean's `x / 0 = 0`\nmeans that with a vanishing denominator the formula is *satisfied* by\n`a_k = 0` and constrains nothing, so the division alone does not carry the\nmathematical content. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.jet_prefix_gb_filtration","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.jet_prefix_gb_filtration","kind":"def","line":77,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/jet_prefix_gb_filtration.lean#L77-L89","doc":"**The jet-level prefix evaluation**\n([`prop:jet-prefix-gb-filtration`](../../../mass-theory/jet-prefix-gb-filtration.md)),\nas a proposition over caller-supplied data:\n\n    a_k = tr_M^{[ℓ]}(β_k^GS) / Σ_λ w_λ · dim Res^{H_k}_{H_3}(V_λ).\n\n**Named, not asserted.**  See the module docstring for what the previous\nencoding claimed instead, and for what this formula would need in order to be\nabout braids rather than about reals. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:jet-prefix-gb-filtration","label":"prop:jet-prefix-gb-filtration","md":"quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/jet-prefix-gb-filtration.md"}],"signatureChunk":0}]}